#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kiten; is a set of 3 tools with multiple functions. Firstly, it is a "
"convenient English to Japanese and Japanese to English dictionary; secondly, "
"it is a Kanji dictionary, with multiple ways to look up specific characters; "
"thirdly, it is a tool to help you learn Kanji."
msgstr ""
"&kiten; je set od 3 alata sa višestrukim funkcijama. Prvo, to je Enskeski na "
"Japanski i Japanski na Engleski riječnik, drugo, to je Kanji riječnik, sa "
"višestrukim načinima gledanja specifičnih kataktera, treće, to je alat koji "
"će ti pomoći da naučis Kanji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Each of these modes is discussed in its own chapter."
msgstr "Svaki od ovih načina je objašnjeno u svom poglavlju."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &kiten;"
msgstr "Evo snimak ekrana &kiten;"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; screenshot"
msgstr "&kiten; snimak ekrana"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Dictionary"
msgstr "Korišćenje riječnika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kiten;'s most basic mode is as a dictionary for looking up both English and "
"Japanese words. You can also add other dictionaries to &kiten;'s list."
msgstr ""
"&kiten; je najosnovniji način kao riječnik za traženje i Engleskih i "
"Japanskih riječi. Možete takođe i dodavati i druge riječnike na &kiten; "
"listu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kiten; uses Jim Breen's Edict and Kanjidic as the default dictionaries. You "
"can find more information at <ulink url=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/"
"edict.html\">the Edict web site</ulink> and <ulink url=\"http://www.csse."
"monash.edu.au/~jwb/kanjidic.html\">the Kanjidic web site</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&kiten; koristi Jim Breenov Edick i Kanjidic kao default riječnike. Možete "
"naći više informacija na <ulink url=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/"
"edict.html\">the Edict web site</ulink> i <ulink url=\"http://www.csse."
"monash.edu.au/~jwb/kanjidic.html\">the Kanjidic web site</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Looking Up Words"
msgstr "Traženje Riječi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To look up words in either language, type them in to the text-edit (much "
"like &konqueror;'s location bar) and press either &Enter; or the "
"<guilabel>Search</guilabel> button on the toolbar (again, much like "
"&konqueror;). &kiten; will then look up the word."
msgstr ""
"Za traženje riječi na bilo kojem jeziku, upišite ih u text-edit (kao "
"&konqueror; mjesto za lokaciju) i pritisnite ili &Enter; ili "
"<guilabel>Search</guilabel> dugme na alatnoj traci (ponovo, kao "
"&konqueror;). &kiten; će onda tražiti riječ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can enter Kanji, Kana and English and get back results from &kiten;. "
"These results of your search will appear in the large results view which "
"takes up the majority of the &kiten; window."
msgstr ""
"Možete upisati Kanji, Kana i Engleski i dobiti rezultate od &kiten;. Ovi "
"rezultati vašeg pretraživanja će se pojaviti u velikom pogledu što zauzima "
"većinu &kiten; prozora."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "searching for an English translation"
msgstr "tražiti Engleski prevod"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; search screenshot"
msgstr "&kiten; traženje snimka ekrana"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filtering"
msgstr "Filtriranje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Often times you will want to filter rare words from your search. &kiten; "
"will do this for you if toggle <menuchoice><guimenu>Search</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Filter Out Rare</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Često ćete želeti filtrirati čudne riječi u vašem pretraživanju. &kiten; će "
"ovo uraditi za vas ako želite <menuchoice><guimenu>Search</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Filter Out Rare</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Not all dictionary files support filtering rare entries - most dictionaries, "
"excluding the two provided by default in &kiten; do not."
msgstr ""
"Ne podržavaju svi riječnici filtriranje čudnih unosa - većina riječnika, "
"uključujući i dva koji su obezbjeđeni defaultom u &kiten; ne podržavaju."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot using filtering of rare words"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana korišteći filtriranje čudnih riječi."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; filtering search"
msgstr "&kiten; filtriranje pretraga"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Common/Uncommon words"
msgstr "Zajedničke/ rijetke riječi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another way to separate information is to filter common and uncommon words, "
"this is useful when you want to focus on the common words and/or have "
"interest on uncommon ones. The only difference between Filter Out Rare and "
"Common/Uncommon options is that here you also get the Rare/Uncommon results."
msgstr ""
"Još jedan način za razdvajanje informacija je filtriranje zajedničke i "
"rijetke riječi, ovo je korisno kad se želite fokusirati na zajedničke rijeci "
"i/ili imate interes u rijetke riječi. Jedina razlika između Filtriranja "
"Čudnih i Zajedničkih/rijetkih opcija je ta da ovdje dobijete i Čudne/Rijetke "
"rezultate."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for match common/uncommon"
msgstr "Snikam ekrana za povezivanje zajedničko/rijetko"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; match common/uncommon"
msgstr "&kiten; povezivanje zajedničko/rijetko"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Searches"
msgstr "Napredna Pretraga"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kiten; supports more advanced searches than plain normal word searches."
msgstr ""
"&kiten;  podržava više napredna pretraživanja od pretraživanja normalnih "
"riječi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Beginning/Ending/Anywhere Searches"
msgstr "Početak/Kraj/Bilo gdje Pretraživanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Beside a search with <guilabel>Exact Match</guilabel> &kiten; has three "
"additional search modes"
msgstr ""
"Pored pretraživanja sa <guilabel>Exact Match</guilabel> &kiten; ima tri "
"dodatna načina pretraživanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To search for the beginning of a word, instead of pressing the "
"<guilabel>Search</guilabel> button on the toolbar or pressing "
"<keycap>Return</keycap> on the text-entry in the toolbar, choose using the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Search</guimenu><guisubmenu>Match Type </"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Match Beginning</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. "
"Similarly, for ending or anywhere searches, choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Search</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Match Type</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice> <guimenuitem>Match Anywhere</guimenuitem> or <guimenuitem>Match "
"Ending</guimenuitem> to search for your text anywhere in or at the end of a "
"word. These search modes work for searches of both languages."
msgstr ""
"Za traženje početne riječi, umjesto pritiskanja <guilabel>Search</guilabel> "
"dugmeta na alatnoj traci ili pritiskanja <keycap>Return</keycap> na mjestu "
"ubacivanja teksta, izaberite korišteći <menuchoice><guimenu>Search</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Match Type </guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Match Beginning</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Za krajnja ilji pretrazivanja bilo gdje, "
"izaberite  <menuchoice><guimenu>Search</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Match Type</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice> <guimenuitem>Match Anywhere</guimenuitem> or "
"<guimenuitem>Match Ending</guimenuitem> da bi tražili vaš tekst bilo gdje "
"ili na kraju. Ovi načini pretraživanja važe za oba jezika."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for match ending search"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana za povezivanje krajnjeg pretraživanja"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; match ending search"
msgstr "&kiten; match ending search povezivanje krajnjeg pretraživanja"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Word type searches"
msgstr "Pretraživanja po vrsi riječi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; supports word type searches such as: verb, noun, adjective, "
"adverb, prefix, suffix, expression or any type. This way you can filter your "
"results more conveniently."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; podržava pretraživanja po vrsti riječi kao što su: glagoli, "
"imenice, pridjevi, prilozi, prefiksi, sufiksi, izraz ili bilo koji tip. Na "
"ovaj način možete filtrirati vaše rezultate povoljnije."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for match word type"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana za povezivanje vrste riječi"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; match word type"
msgstr "&kiten; povezivanje vrste riječi"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "Searching in Results"
msgstr "Pretraživanje u Rezultatima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kiten; can also help you refine your searches by allowing you to search for "
"new text in the results generated by a previous search. To do this, just "
"choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Search</guimenu><guimenuitem>Search in Results</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> to perform your search. Similarly to beginning/"
"ending/anywhere searches, this works for both languages too."
msgstr ""
"&kiten; vam također može pomoći rafinirati vaša pretraživanja tako što će "
"vam dozvoliti da tražite novi tekst u rezultatima generisanim prethodnim "
"pretraživanjima. Da bi uradili ovo, samo odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Search</guimenu><guimenuitem>Search in Results</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> za obavljanje vaših pretraživanja. Slično kao "
"početak/kraj/bilo gdje pretraživanja, ovo radi za oba jezika."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for search in results"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana za pretragu u rezultatima"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; search in results"
msgstr "&kiten; pretraga u rezultatima"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Verb Deinflection"
msgstr "Glagol Deinflection"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kiten; can deinflect verbs you search for. The \"Deinflect\" option tries "
"to unconjugate Japanese verbs and shows you a message on top of the results "
"about the type of verb you entered. If you search a lot of Japanese text you "
"might consider using this option until you get used to handling Japanese "
"verb forms."
msgstr ""
"&kiten; može promijeniti oblik glagola koje tražite. \"Deinflekt\" opcija "
"pokušava ukloniti konjugaciju japanskih glagola i pokazuje vam poruku na "
"vrhu rezultata o vrsti glagola kojeg ste ubacili. Ako tražite mnogo "
"Japanskog teksta možete razmisliti o tome da koristite opciju dok se ne "
"naviknete na upisivanje forme Japanskih glagola."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for verb deinflection"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana za glagol deinflection"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; verb deinflection search"
msgstr "&kiten; pretraživanje glagola deinflection"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "Looking Up Kanji"
msgstr "Tražiti Kanji"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kiten; has features that makes finding the one kanji you want easy from "
"over 14,000 in the default dictionary."
msgstr ""
"&kiten;  ima značajke koje olakšavaju traženje kanji koji želite od 14,000 u "
"defaultnom riječniku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking on any Kanji in the main result view will show details on that "
"particular Kanji. This can sometimes be the fastest way to look up a Kanji."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na bilo koji Kanji u glavnim rezultatima će pokazati detalje o tom "
"Kanji. Ovo ponekad može biti najbrži način za pronalazak Kanji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kanji searches are also filtered according to whether "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Search</guimenu><guimenuitem>Filter Out Rare</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> is checked."
msgstr ""
"Kanji pretraživanja su također filtrirana prema <menuchoice><guimenu>Search</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Filter Out Rare</guimenuitem></menuchoice> provjeren."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "Regular Searching"
msgstr "Redovna Pretraživanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can search with English and Japanese search strings the exact same way "
"you can with the normal dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Možete pretraživati sa Engleskim i Japanskim stringovima pretraživanja na "
"isti način kao što možete sa normalnim riječnikom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "Radical Searching"
msgstr "Radikalna Pretraživanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use &kiten;'s radical search dialog to search for Kanji with a "
"combination of radicals and a certain stroke count. Choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Search</guimenu><guimenuitem>Radical Selector</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> to open the radical search dialog."
msgstr ""
"Možete koristiti &kiten; dijalog radikalnih pretraživanja za pretraživanje "
"Kanji sa kombinacijom radikalnih i određenih crta. Odaberi "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Search</guimenu><guimenuitem>Radical Selector</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> da bi otvorili dijalog radikalnih pretraživanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To choose the radicals you want to be in your Kanji, select one them from "
"the buttons at the bottom of the window. To display possible radicals to "
"select from this buttons with a certain number of strokes, choose this "
"number of strokes from the spinboxes just above the buttons. The radicals "
"you choose will appear in the listbox at the top."
msgstr ""
"Da bi odabrali radikale koje želite da budu u vašem Kanji, odaberite jedno "
"od dugmadi na dnu prozora. Da bi prikazali moguće radikale da odabiru iz "
"ovog dugmeta sa određenim brojem udara, izaberite ovaj broj udara sa spin "
"kutije odmah iznad dugmića. Radikali koje ste odabrali će se pojaviti na "
"listi na vrhu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To choose how many strokes your Kanji should have, just enter the values "
"into the spin boxes below the results area."
msgstr ""
"Da bi odabrali koliko udara će vaš Kanji treba da ima, samo ubacite "
"vrijednosti u spin kutijici ispod rezultata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To perform the lookup, press the button that matches the kanji you wanted to "
"look up."
msgstr ""
"Da biste obavili pretragu, pritisnite dugme koje odgovara kanji koji ste "
"hteli da potražite."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for radical selector"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana za radikalni selektor"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; radical selector"
msgstr "&kiten; radicalni selektor"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid "Grade Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje Razreda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To get a list of all Kanji in a certain grade, enter that into the search "
"box as \"G:1\" (G: is the Kanjidic tag for grade)."
msgstr ""
"Da bi dobili listu svih Kanji u određenom razredu, ubacite to u kutiju za "
"pretraživanje kao \"G:1\" (G: je Kanjiska oznaka za razred)."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for kanji grade search"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana za kanji pretraživač razreda"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; kanji grade search"
msgstr "&kiten; kanji pretraživanje razreda"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stroke Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje Udara"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To get a list of all Kanji with a certain number of strokes, enter that "
"number in the text-entry in the toolbar as \"S:2\"."
msgstr ""
"Da bi dobili listu svih Kanji sa svim određenim brojem udara, ubacite taj "
"broj u mjestu za ubacivanje teksta u alatnoj traci kao \"S:2\"."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for kanji strokes search"
msgstr "Snimak za kanji pretraživanje udara"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; kanji strokes search"
msgstr "&kiten; kanji pretraživanje udara"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid "Kanji List"
msgstr "Kanji Lista"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This part of the Kanji Browser lets you visualize a list of kanji filtered "
"by grade and number of strokes. By Clicking on a kanji you can get detailed "
"information about it. Kanji Browser separates the list in Jouyou, Jinmeiyou "
"and non-Jouyou kanji. All this kanji is available thanks to the KANJIDIC "
"dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj deo Kanji browsera dopušta ti vizualizovati listu kanji filtriranja "
"razreda i broja udara, Klikom na kanji možete dobiti detaljne informacije o "
"tome. Kanji brovser dijeli listu na Jouyou, Jinmeiyou i ne-Jouyou kanji. Svi "
"ovi Kanji su dostupni zahvaljujući KANJIDIC riječnika."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for kanji list"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana za kanji listu"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:339
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; kanji list"
msgstr "&kiten; kanji lista"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "Kanji Information"
msgstr "Kanji Informacije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This part shows you detailed information about a kanji such as: kanji stroke "
"order, number of strokes, readings and meanings."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj dio pokazuje detaljne informacije o kanji kao što su: kanji red udara, "
"broj udara, čitanja i značenja."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot for kanji information"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana za kanji informacije"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiten; kanji information"
msgstr "&kiten; kanji informacije"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "Miscellaneous"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter describes miscellaneous features that can be used in both modes "
"in &kiten;'s main window."
msgstr ""
"Ovo poglavlje opisuje razne značajke koje se mogu koristiti na oba načina u "
"&kiten; glavnom prozoru."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid "The History"
msgstr "Historija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kiten; keeps track of all of your queries in the input field. You can see "
"your last results by clicking on the check mark at the right of the input "
"field. To go forward one in the history, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Forward</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. To go backward one "
"in the history, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</guimenu><guimenuitem>Back</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"&kiten; prati sve vaše pretrage. Možete vidjeti vaše poslednje rezultate "
"klikom na kvačocu na desnoj strani. Da bi otišli naprijed u historiji "
"odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</guimenu><guimenuitem>Forward</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Da bi otišli nazad u historiji, odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Go</guimenu><guimenuitem>Back</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "Fontovi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose the font that &kiten; uses in its result view. Go to the "
"&kiten; configuration dialog, which can be opened by choosing "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Kiten...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Select the <guilabel>Font</guilabel> page of the "
"dialog and select the font in the font-chooser."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati font koji &kiten; koristi u svojim prikazivanjima rezultata. "
"Idi na &kiten; dijalog konfiguracije, koji se može otvoriti tako što "
"odaberete <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"Kiten...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>.  Odaberite <guilabel>Font</guilabel> "
"stranicu dijaloga i odaberite font."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&Qt; 's font-substitution system makes it so a Japanese font will always be "
"substituted for Japanese characters, even if the font you specify doesn't "
"include them. Thus, you can choose any font in the chooser and everything "
"should still display fine."
msgstr ""
"&Qt; sistem izmjene fonta radi da Japanski font uvijek bude izmjenjen za "
"Japanske likove, čak i ako ih font koji ste naveli ne sadrži. Dakle, možete "
"odabrati bilo koji font i sve bi se trebalo prikazivati dobro."

